(5058943, 738596, 12733, '<td valign="top">Well, I guess there''s red under all that water, but couldn''t you have found some really red leaves? Some autumn leaves are the most amazing, rich red; these have a few red lines running through them.</td>', 'Well, I guess there''s red under all that water, but couldn''t you have found some really red leaves? Some autumn leaves are the most amazing, rich red; these have a few red lines running through them.', '2008-11-12 07:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
