(5058978, 737835, 72929, '<td valign="top">OooOooh. The only time I saw one of these (in all places) was on Saddle road in Hawaii on the big island. Saddle road goes between Mauna Loa and Mauna Kea, and one half of it is the worst POS stretch of road ever. The other half (where I saw the GT) was freshly paved and very curvy and hilly. I was jealous :)</td>', 'OooOooh. The only time I saw one of these (in all places) was on Saddle road in Hawaii on the big island. Saddle road goes between Mauna Loa and Mauna Kea, and one half of it is the worst POS stretch of road ever. The other half (where I saw the GT) was freshly paved and very curvy and hilly. I was jealous :)', '2008-11-12 07:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5058979, 737111, 79955, '<td valign="top">Nice &amp; unique image. Well constructed &amp; I like the lighting., but the grain/noise i can see in the gray areas are distracting. 6</td>', 'Nice & unique image. Well constructed & I like the lighting., but the grain/noise i can see in the gray areas are distracting. 6', '2008-11-12 07:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5058983, 738596, 79955, '<td valign="top">insufficient red to make an impact.</td>', 'insufficient red to make an impact.', '2008-11-12 07:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5058985, 738355, 72929, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of fisheye, but it makes the red cottage really tiny in the frame and almost inconsequential. The log is the dominant element.</td>', 'Interesting use of fisheye, but it makes the red cottage really tiny in the frame and almost inconsequential. The log is the dominant element.', '2008-11-12 07:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5058986, 738685, 72929, '<td valign="top">Looks neat in a thumbnail, but you have some posterization in the sky. Could be the JPEG compression / conversion.</td>', 'Looks neat in a thumbnail, but you have some posterization in the sky. Could be the JPEG compression / conversion.', '2008-11-12 07:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5058994, 738629, 79955, '<td valign="top">need to reduce the shadow caused by the frontal flash. Try to use the flash off camera at and angle &amp; use a reflector to fill obvious shadow areas.<br/>Also your subject is too near the background. Try moving him away from the background say (3-4ft away) then select the right DOF to ensure the background is blurred.</td>', 'need to reduce the shadow caused by the frontal flash. Try to use the flash off camera at and angle & use a reflector to fill obvious shadow areas.Also your subject is too near the background. Try moving him away from the background say (3-4ft away) then select the right DOF to ensure the background is blurred.', '2008-11-12 07:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5058995, 738676, 72929, '<td valign="top">Haha clever title. "put on your red light!" Thanks for getting that song stuck in my head now.</td>', 'Haha clever title. "put on your red light!" Thanks for getting that song stuck in my head now.', '2008-11-12 07:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
