(5059061, 738514, 87808, '<td valign="top">That brings back memories, I used to get the Beano every week about 25 years ago.  I always wanted the Dennis and Gnasher T Shirt and never could afford to join the club. So WOW thanks for the memory, brought a smile onto my face.</td>', 'That brings back memories, I used to get the Beano every week about 25 years ago.  I always wanted the Dennis and Gnasher T Shirt and never could afford to join the club. So WOW thanks for the memory, brought a smile onto my face.', '2008-11-12 08:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
