(5060369, 738605, 2490, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Needs a smaller f-stop for more depth of field so that all leaves are sharp.  8</td>', 'Very nice.  Needs a smaller f-stop for more depth of field so that all leaves are sharp.  8', '2008-11-12 16:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
