(5060405, 738159, 96915, '<td valign="top">I just don''t know what to make of this one.  Seems a little like a photograph of an advertisement, which doesn''t really work for me.</td>', 'I just don''t know what to make of this one.  Seems a little like a photograph of an advertisement, which doesn''t really work for me.', '2008-11-12 16:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
