(5060413, 737831, 96915, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but the lighting and composition just don''t quite work here.  I might have gone in for a close up of the "little things" and done something (faster lens, diffused light) to avoid such a harsh flash.</td>', 'I like the concept, but the lighting and composition just don''t quite work here.  I might have gone in for a close up of the "little things" and done something (faster lens, diffused light) to avoid such a harsh flash.', '2008-11-12 16:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
