(5062670, 738458, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flowers.  Great colour and composition. I''d like to know your method of getting red flowers to actually look so red. I am always disappointed to find mine turn out pink. 9</td>', 'Beautiful flowers.  Great colour and composition. I''d like to know your method of getting red flowers to actually look so red. I am always disappointed to find mine turn out pink. 9', '2008-11-13 19:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
