(5062800, 738249, 4010, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and lighting for this.  Could have used some color correction to make the ketchup less brown.</td>', 'I like the composition and lighting for this.  Could have used some color correction to make the ketchup less brown.', '2008-11-13 20:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
