(5062820, 737786, 96881, '<td valign="top">Would have loved a little more sky in this photo to balance it a little more, and not have the tops of the trees cropped out.  Other then that, great submission</td>', 'Would have loved a little more sky in this photo to balance it a little more, and not have the tops of the trees cropped out.  Other then that, great submission', '2008-11-13 20:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
