(5066461, 738700, 52549, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing image. There is a lot going on but it still has a sort of "quietness" to it. I really like it. The many different shades of red are wonderful.</td>', 'Very intriguing image. There is a lot going on but it still has a sort of "quietness" to it. I really like it. The many different shades of red are wonderful.', '2008-11-16 11:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
