(5066464, 738496, 52549, '<td valign="top">Wow! Stunning. The stars to the left and the red clouds to the right.... This should do very well.</td>', 'Wow! Stunning. The stars to the left and the red clouds to the right.... This should do very well.', '2008-11-16 11:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
