(5066487, 738237, 52549, '<td valign="top">Very good. I love the silvery look and the reflection, also the focus is excellent. I hope you don''t mind a small nitpick: I wish you''d cleaned up the tube nozzle.</td>', 'Very good. I love the silvery look and the reflection, also the focus is excellent. I hope you don''t mind a small nitpick: I wish you''d cleaned up the tube nozzle.', '2008-11-16 11:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
