(5066805, 738651, 54478, '<td valign="top">The counter top/background distracts from the rest of the photo. Photo also seems a bit out of focus. I Like the use of the green M&amp;M.</td>', 'The counter top/background distracts from the rest of the photo. Photo also seems a bit out of focus. I Like the use of the green M&M.', '2008-11-16 19:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5066808, 738340, 54478, '<td valign="top">Nice coloring. I wish the background would have been level. The blue bulb at the end of the vase also takes the eye away from the flower.</td>', 'Nice coloring. I wish the background would have been level. The blue bulb at the end of the vase also takes the eye away from the flower.', '2008-11-16 19:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5066809, 738268, 94265, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful setter. Lovely pet portrait, a nice scene. Good focus too.</td>', 'What a beautiful setter. Lovely pet portrait, a nice scene. Good focus too.', '2008-11-16 19:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5066810, 738514, 54478, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. The background is distracting. Good lighting.</td>', 'Nice photo. The background is distracting. Good lighting.', '2008-11-16 19:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5066811, 737051, 54478, '<td valign="top">Simple and works well.</td>', 'Simple and works well.', '2008-11-16 19:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5066813, 737972, 54478, '<td valign="top">Great photo. I love the DOF. I only wish the leaves at the top of the photo would have been a little more focused.</td>', 'Great photo. I love the DOF. I only wish the leaves at the top of the photo would have been a little more focused.', '2008-11-16 19:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5066814, 737450, 54478, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the color red. The reflection of the light off the surface of the straw berry on the right is a tad distracting.</td>', 'Nice use of the color red. The reflection of the light off the surface of the straw berry on the right is a tad distracting.', '2008-11-16 19:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5066815, 738337, 54478, '<td valign="top">Composition is lacking and the photo is out of focus. Next time, position the butter fly off to one side and use a tripod. I know shots like these can be difficult when you don''t have any control over the subject.</td>', 'Composition is lacking and the photo is out of focus. Next time, position the butter fly off to one side and use a tripod. I know shots like these can be difficult when you don''t have any control over the subject.', '2008-11-16 19:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5066816, 737931, 54478, '<td valign="top">Great simple photo. Did you paint with light? Love the lighting.</td>', 'Great simple photo. Did you paint with light? Love the lighting.', '2008-11-16 19:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5066818, 738390, 54478, '<td valign="top">Very creative.</td>', 'Very creative.', '2008-11-16 19:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5066832, 738273, 81362, '<td valign="top">Love the sense of motion and the well-balanced composition. Gradations of red to orange managed with a subtle touch. Well done.</td>', 'Love the sense of motion and the well-balanced composition. Gradations of red to orange managed with a subtle touch. Well done.', '2008-11-16 19:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5066836, 738628, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good eye for a position that gives a nice graphic curve to the taillight trail. I wish the close side of the road could be darker, but recognize the limitations of basic editing.</td>', 'Good eye for a position that gives a nice graphic curve to the taillight trail. I wish the close side of the road could be darker, but recognize the limitations of basic editing.', '2008-11-16 19:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5066845, 738559, 81362, '<td valign="top">Wish the background could have been less cluttered, particularly by the guy with the red necktie. Perhaps stepping to your right a bit would have helped. Red skirt, necktie, and hair (nominally, although rather orange here) and red on the boxes fit the challenge, but that expression (snarl?) makes the image less appealing (and doesn''t communicate "strength" very well, if that was the intent).</td>', 'Wish the background could have been less cluttered, particularly by the guy with the red necktie. Perhaps stepping to your right a bit would have helped. Red skirt, necktie, and hair (nominally, although rather orange here) and red on the boxes fit the challenge, but that expression (snarl?) makes the image less appealing (and doesn''t communicate "strength" very well, if that was the intent).', '2008-11-16 19:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5066851, 738249, 81362, '<td valign="top">Interesting how ketchup isn''t very red. The puddle at the bottom has some interesting qualities, but the dribbles over the top and down the front of the container doom this image to a low score.</td>', 'Interesting how ketchup isn''t very red. The puddle at the bottom has some interesting qualities, but the dribbles over the top and down the front of the container doom this image to a low score.', '2008-11-16 19:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5066925, 738436, 54478, '<td valign="top">The stems add some nice texture to the photo. Could have used a polarizing filter to reduce the reflection on the tomatoes. Neat photo.</td>', 'The stems add some nice texture to the photo. Could have used a polarizing filter to reduce the reflection on the tomatoes. Neat photo.', '2008-11-16 21:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
