(5070116, 738249, 83313, '<td valign="top">Too much of a good thing? Nice, but could easily be improved.<br/> <br/>1) straighten a little.<br/> <br/>2) Needs to be adjusted *just a little* to give it some wow color. I popped this into Paintshop Pro to see. Took about 15 seconds of adjustments to give it a lot more pop using levels, curves and saturation.<br/> <br/>A 5, but with those easy adjustments it would be a 6 or 7.</td>', 'Too much of a good thing? Nice, but could easily be improved. 1) straighten a little. 2) Needs to be adjusted *just a little* to give it some wow color. I popped this into Paintshop Pro to see. Took about 15 seconds of adjustments to give it a lot more pop using levels, curves and saturation. A 5, but with those easy adjustments it would be a 6 or 7.', '2008-11-18 21:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5070119, 738159, 51747, '<td valign="top">To me this looks like a cartoon. It is a nice cartoon but I''m not sure it is a photo either.  Overall it looks a little soft.  I''m torn as to how I should vote this. I''m giving you the benefit of the doubt that you''re one of the most creative members here and voting this high. I''ll be anxious to see how this was done.</td>', 'To me this looks like a cartoon. It is a nice cartoon but I''m not sure it is a photo either.  Overall it looks a little soft.  I''m torn as to how I should vote this. I''m giving you the benefit of the doubt that you''re one of the most creative members here and voting this high. I''ll be anxious to see how this was done.', '2008-11-18 21:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
