(5071385, 738388, 72136, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your comments. <br/> <br/>I live next to one of the best places for surfing in Greece and I get to see the surfing beach in every season and time of day (which makes me wish I had a 400mm zoom... ;)<br/> <br/>The sun was directly opposite of us and there were also some clouds, thus the strange lighting on the waves. Unfortunately, I overdid it with the Shadows/Highlights and there really are halos over the sails as mom2two points out. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Thank you all for your comments.  I live next to one of the best places for surfing in Greece and I get to see the surfing beach in every season and time of day (which makes me wish I had a 400mm zoom... ;) The sun was directly opposite of us and there were also some clouds, thus the strange lighting on the waves. Unfortunately, I overdid it with the Shadows/Highlights and there really are halos over the sails as mom2two points out.  ', '2008-11-19 04:21:28.000000', NULL, 0),
