(5071534, 738508, 17153, '<td valign="top">Yaay! Got the brown! Now it''s time to get serious... Thank you all for the low votes, but I really don''t understand the 5 to 10 votes!? I would vote 2 on a crappy image like this, 1 is reserved for crappy &amp; DNMC ones.<br/> <br/>The title is actually inspired by the Carl Sagan''s book "Pale Blue Dot" - Earth as seen from far in the universe. The pale red dot is what hopefully a certain political party is going to become in the world''s memory...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-11-19 04:59:31.</i></td>', 'Yaay! Got the brown! Now it''s time to get serious... Thank you all for the low votes, but I really don''t understand the 5 to 10 votes!? I would vote 2 on a crappy image like this, 1 is reserved for crappy & DNMC ones. The title is actually inspired by the Carl Sagan''s book "Pale Blue Dot" - Earth as seen from far in the universe. The pale red dot is what hopefully a certain political party is going to become in the world''s memory...', '2008-11-19 04:55:17.000000', '2008-11-19 04:59:31.000000', 0),
