(5071797, 738273, 86447, '<td valign="top">Amazing score!  But so deserved because the image is AMAZING!   Congratulations.  It''s just perfect.  I think it''s the highest scoring image this entire year!  Beautiful.<br/> <br/>EDIT:  Oops... <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=29011" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Techo</a>''s still got you on the score (with a 8.388) for the year... but you bumped me to third place.  I don''t mind at all... since yours is very superior to mine.  <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-11-19 18:06:59.</i></td>', 'Amazing score!  But so deserved because the image is AMAZING!   Congratulations.  It''s just perfect.  I think it''s the highest scoring image this entire year!  Beautiful. EDIT:  Oops...  Techo''s still got you on the score (with a 8.388) for the year... but you bumped me to third place.  I don''t mind at all... since yours is very superior to mine.  ', '2008-11-19 07:21:59.000000', '2008-11-19 18:06:59.000000', 0),
