(5071943, 738495, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is a perfect poem. the elements interact strongly with each other while never resolving into a single story. your timing is perfect. clearly he is ingesting the food, but the gesture could just as easily be one of ejection.<br/> <br/>Vertigo created by a perfect balance.</td>', 'this is a perfect poem. the elements interact strongly with each other while never resolving into a single story. your timing is perfect. clearly he is ingesting the food, but the gesture could just as easily be one of ejection. Vertigo created by a perfect balance.', '2008-11-19 08:21:15.000000', NULL, 0),
