(5072078, 738596, 58457, '<td valign="top">I saw your post in the posthumous thread... I gave you a five, and after further review, maybe you should have had a 6...  I do like this shot, but when it comes to "Red" it doesn''t really say anything to me...  If the theme were Autumn, or Rain, I think you would''ve done much better.<br/> <br/>Standing on its own though, outside of the challenge I think it works well!</td>', 'I saw your post in the posthumous thread... I gave you a five, and after further review, maybe you should have had a 6...  I do like this shot, but when it comes to "Red" it doesn''t really say anything to me...  If the theme were Autumn, or Rain, I think you would''ve done much better. Standing on its own though, outside of the challenge I think it works well!', '2008-11-19 09:03:45.000000', NULL, 0),
