(5072119, 738596, 34192, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Hard to believe this scored a 4 considering other images in the challenge.  And I love the crop, or lack of it - it seems so final, which I thought, going by the title, was the point.  For what its worth, I gave you a seven.  But I only did one pass and gave up after 20% (disenchantment) so 7 was my highest score for the challenge.  Wonderfully seen and captured.</td>', 'Wow.  Hard to believe this scored a 4 considering other images in the challenge.  And I love the crop, or lack of it - it seems so final, which I thought, going by the title, was the point.  For what its worth, I gave you a seven.  But I only did one pass and gave up after 20% (disenchantment) so 7 was my highest score for the challenge.  Wonderfully seen and captured.', '2008-11-19 09:23:05.000000', NULL, 0),
