(5073043, 738108, 24486, '<td valign="top">Wow, shot without a tripod, I''m impressed. Trees in the foreground really make this stand out. Congrats on the 4th place.</td>', 'Wow, shot without a tripod, I''m impressed. Trees in the foreground really make this stand out. Congrats on the 4th place.', '2008-11-19 14:18:57.000000', NULL, 0),
