(5074979, 738649, 53316, '<td valign="top">I think the image itself is beautiful! My problem would be with the border - because the outside edge is so dark (the lovely vignette) it doesn''t work at all with a white border, to me, because my eye is brought to the border and the harsh line between black and white.. No border or a black one would be better, and that way the light part that stands out would be your subject alone.</td>', 'I think the image itself is beautiful! My problem would be with the border - because the outside edge is so dark (the lovely vignette) it doesn''t work at all with a white border, to me, because my eye is brought to the border and the harsh line between black and white.. No border or a black one would be better, and that way the light part that stands out would be your subject alone.', '2008-11-20 01:56:47.000000', NULL, 0),
